  "description": "<p>This area rug brings the spirit of the outdoors into your living space with its detailed Bigfoot design. Crafted for both durability and comfort, it adds a touch of adventure and rustic charm. Ideal for nature lovers, this rug enhances the ambiance of any room while providing a cozy feel underfoot.</p><h3>Product Highlights</h3><ul>\n<li>Features a unique and detailed Sasquatch design, perfect for adding personality.</li>\n<li>Adds rustic charm, complementing themes of nature, forest, and wildlife.</li>\n<li>Constructed from premium materials for durability and comfort.</li>\n<li>Equipped with a non-slip backing to ensure safety and stability.</li>\n<li>Designed for easy maintenance with simple cleaning methods.</li>\n</ul><h3>Specifications</h3><table border=\"1\" cellpadding=\"6\" style=\"border-collapse:collapse;width:100%\">\n<tr>\n<th align=\"left\" width=\"35%\">Attribute</th>\n<th align=\"left\">Value</th>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Rug Form</td>\n<td>Area Rug</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Item Shape</td>\n<td>Rectangular</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Weave Type</td>\n<td>Machine-Made</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Pile Height</td>\n<td>Low Pile</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Construction Type</td>\n<td>Machine Made</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Indoor/Outdoor Usage</td>\n<td>Indoor</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Room Type</td>\n<td>Living Room, Bedroom, Cabin</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Water Resistance</td>\n<td>Not Water Resistant</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Pattern</td>\n<td>Bigfoot</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Theme</td>\n<td>Outdoor Adventure</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Style</td>\n<td>Rustic</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Number of Pieces</td>\n<td>1</td>\n</tr>\n</table><h3>Material &amp; Care</h3><table border=\"1\" cellpadding=\"6\" style=\"border-collapse:collapse;width:100%\">\n<tr>\n<th align=\"left\" width=\"35%\">Item</th>\n<th align=\"left\">Detail</th>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Material Type</td>\n<td>Sponge - Memory Foam</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Backing Material</td>\n<td>High-quality Epoxy</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Product Care Instructions</td>\n<td>Spot Clean Only</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Cleaning Method</td>\n<td>Regular vacuuming or gentle washing</td>\n</tr>\n</table><h3>Where It Works</h3><p>This Bigfoot area rug is suitable for various indoor settings, including living rooms, bedrooms, and cabins. Its rustic theme makes it a fitting addition for spaces designed for nature enthusiasts or those seeking an adventurous touch.</p>",
